rokeColor=#8a5ab5;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="335" width="180" height="122" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="template" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;MemeTemplate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«aggregate root»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;id: TemplateId&lt;br&gt;name: String&lt;br&gt;status: TemplateStatus&lt;br&gt;version: int&lt;br&gt;image: ImageInfo&lt;br&gt;profile: MemeProfile&lt;br&gt;origin: Origin&lt;br&gt;draft() · defineSlot() · redefineSlot() · removeSlot()&lt;br&gt;reviseProfile() · adoptProfile() · restoreProfile() · approve() · retire() · rename()' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#fff08a;strokeColor=#c9b300;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="165" width="380" height="223" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="slot" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Slot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«entity»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;slotNo: int  (id in template)&lt;br&gt;role: String&lt;br&gt;maxChars: int&lt;br&gt;required: boolean&lt;br&gt;x, y, width, height: int&lt;br&gt;fitsWithin(image) · accepts(text)' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c9b300;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="165" width="240" height="172" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="profile" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;MemeProfile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«value object»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;meaning: String&lt;br&gt;usageExamples: List&lt;br&gt;emoti