tring  (≤ 1200)&lt;br&gt;sourceName · url&lt;br&gt;license' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#fde7c2;strokeColor=#b59a5a;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="480" width="310" height="121" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="imageinfo" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;ImageInfo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«value object»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;imageKey · width · height&lt;br&gt;sha256 · phash' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#fde7c2;strokeColor=#b59a5a;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="660" width="300" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tstatus" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;TemplateStatus&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«enum»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;DRAFT → APPROVED&lt;br&gt;DRAFT | APPROVED → RETIRED&lt;br&gt;RETIRED is final: nothing changes it' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="660" width="250" height="121" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="report" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ReportCase&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#555555&quot;&gt;«aggregate root»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin:4px 0&quot;&gt;templateId: UUID  →MemeTemplate&lt;br&gt;reports: Report[]  (open and closed)&lt;br&gt;one open report per person; a new one replaces it&lt;br&gt;submit(user, reason, comment)&lt;br&gt;close(resolution, automatic, note)  [dismiss · resolve]&lt;br&gt;reopenAutomaticallyDismissed(since)&lt;br&gt;the model's proposal is kept with the review queue" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#fff08a;strokeColor=#c9b300;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="925" width="330" height="189" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="reportitem" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«entity»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;userId: UUID  →User&lt;br&gt;reason: ReportReason&lt;br&gt;comment: String&lt;br&gt;createdAt: Instant&lt;br&gt;closing?: resolution · automatic · note · at' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c9b300;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="1180" width="330" height="155" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="suggestion" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Suggestion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«value object»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;isMeme: boolean&lt;br&gt;meaning · usageExamples&lt;br&gt;emotions · tags · imageText&lt;br&gt;reasoning · keep&lt;br&gt;isUsableDescription()' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#fde7c2;strokeColor=#b59a5a;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="925" width="300" height="155" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="reason" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;ReportReason&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«enum»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;WRONG_TAGS&lt;br&gt;WRONG_MEANING&lt;br&gt;NOT_A_MEME&lt;br&gt;INAPPROPRIATE&lt;br&gt;OTHER' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="1180" width="150" height="155" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="standing" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Standing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«read model (derived)»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;administrator&lt;br&gt;adopted: int&lt;br&gt;setAside: int&lt;br&gt;built from past cases' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#b7e1a1;strokeColor=#5f9e45;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="1180" width="130" height="138" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="reportpol" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;ReportPolicy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«policy / domain service»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;checked before submit():&lt;br&gt;dailyReportsPerUser · cooldown&lt;br&gt;weightOf(standing)&lt;br&gt;analyzeAtWeight · autoApplyAtWeight&lt;br&gt;dailyAnalyses (whole site)&lt;br&gt;NOT_A_MEME · INAPPROPRIATE → a person' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#d9b8f0;strokeColor=#8a5ab5;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="1180" width="250" height="172" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="index" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;SearchIndexEntry&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«read model (derived)»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;templateId: UUID&lt;br&gt;searchText: String&lt;br&gt;embedding: float[1024]&lt;br&gt;slotLayout: json&lt;br&gt;sourceUpdatedAt · indexedAt' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#b7e1a1;strokeColor=#5f9e45;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1580" y="165" width="300" height="155" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="fusion" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;ConvexFusion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«policy / domain service»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;semantic 0.7 + keyword 0.3&lt;br&gt;each list scaled to 0..1&lt;br&gt;fuse(dense, keyword, w)' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#d9b8f0;strokeColor=#8a5ab5;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1910" y="165" width="220" height="121" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="stext" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;SearchText&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«value object»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;name · aliases · meaning&lt;br&gt;usageExamples · emotions&lt;br&gt;tags · imageText  → one text' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#fde7c2;strokeColor=#b59a5a;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1580" y="380" width="300" height="121" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="hit" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«value object»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;id: UUID&lt;br&gt;score: double' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#fde7c2;strokeColor=#b59a5a;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1910" y="330" width="220" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="favorite" value='&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Favorite&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style="font-size:11px;color:#555555"&gt;«aggregate root»&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size="1" style="margin:4px 0"&gt;userId: UUID  →User&lt;br&gt;templateId: UUID  →MemeTemplate&lt;br&gt;createdAt: Instant&lt;br&gt;identified by user + meme&lt;br&gt;make(user, meme, now)' style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fillColor=#fff08a;strokeColor=#c9b300;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1580" y="570" width="300" height="155" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l_c1" value="0..*" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="924" y="203" width="36" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l_c2" value="0..*" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="696" y="394" width="36" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l_c3" value="1..*" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="696" y="1120" width="36" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l_sync" value="state" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="195" width="40" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="status_body" value="This is the TARGET design, not the code today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today the domain package holds only MemeTemplate (with Slot),&lt;br&gt;TemplateStatus and User. Origin, Reference, ReportPolicy,&lt;br&gt;Suggestion, SearchText and ConvexFusion sit in application.&lt;br&gt;ReportCase, Report, Favorite and ProfileChange are real.&lt;br&gt;ImageInfo and UserId do not exist yet.&lt;br&gt;Standing is a read model behind ReporterPort. The proposal and the&lt;br&gt;review line (claiming, retries) stay in the review queue table.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where the code differs from the picture: MemeProfile, Slot,&lt;br&gt;Reference and the vision model port (with Suggestion) sit in&lt;br&gt;shared, because several contexts use them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Events are an analysis tool. The code records state and the&lt;br&gt;search index is reconciled by state (decision 3), not by events.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Relations between the contexts: see context-map.drawio.png." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#333333;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="575" width="380" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_root" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#fff08a;strokeColor=#c9b300;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="83" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt_root" value="aggregate root" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="82" width="220" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_entity" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c9b300;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="83" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt_entity" value="entity" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="82" width="220" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_value" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#fde7c2;strokeColor=#b59a5a;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="83" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt_value" value="value object" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="82" width="220" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_enum" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="83" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt_enum" value="enum" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="82" width="220" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_policy" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#d9b8f0;strokeColor=#8a5ab5;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="83" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt_policy" value="policy / domain service" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="82" width="220" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_model" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#b7e1a1;strokeColor=#5f9e45;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="83" width="22" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt_model" value="read model (derived)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="82" width="220" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_c" style="endArrow=none;startArrow=diamondThin;startFill=1;startSize=12;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#333333;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1570" y="92" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1620" y="92" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt_c" value="composition: lives and dies with the root" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="82" width="290" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_r" style="endArrow=open;endSize=8;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#555555;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1930" y="92" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1970" y="92" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt_r" value="refers to another aggregate by ID" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1980" y="82" width="215" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value='&lt;b&gt;1. An aggregate keeps together what one command must keep consistent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ingest, approve, retire and slot edits all land on MemeTemplate;&lt;br&gt;submitting, dismissing, resolving and reopening reports land on ReportCase.&lt;br&gt;The queues that wait for the model are not domain: no TaggingJob or ReportReview.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. ReportCase replaces the former MemeReport&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Resolving closes every report about one meme at once, so the boundary is all&lt;br&gt;the reports of a meme, not a single one. One Report per reporter; a new one replaces the old.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Evidence for the boundaries&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;"Template approved" is the pivotal event: before it is curation (draft, tagging,&lt;br&gt;slot edits), after it is use (search, favorite, report). The language changes too:&lt;br&gt;the admin side says template, the user side says meme. So Curation and Discovery are apart.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. What is not an aggregate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SearchIndexEntry is a read model rebuilt from the state of the templates; searches are only logged,&lt;br&gt;outside the domain, because no rule depends on them. ProfileChange stores a profile revision.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. Terms&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Curation says template and Discovery says meme; the same thing before and after approval.' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="824" width="580" height="520" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>